{"strongs": "H3293", "word": "יַ֫עַר", "translit": "ya.ar", "root": "יער", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "honeycomb", "definition": "II. יַ֫עַר noun [masculine] honeycomb , — absolute יַעַר 1Sam 14:25 ; 1Sam 14:26 suffix יַעְרִי Song 5:1 — honeycomb , containing honey 1Sam 14:25 (where read וְיַעַר הָיָה עַלפְּֿנֵּי הַשָּׂדֶה with ᵐ5 We Dr Kit in Kau AT, instead of see as in MT); וַיָּבוֺא העם אֶלהַֿיַּעַר 1Sam 14:26 (|| דבשׁ 1Sam 14:25 ) and when the people came to the honeycomb behold its bees had departed (see ᵐ5 We Dr Kit VB ); אָכַלְתִּי יַעְרִי עִםדִּֿבְשִׁי Song 5:1 see also I. יַעֲרָה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3642')\">BDB3642</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3293')\">H3293</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3641')\">BDB3641</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3643')\">BDB3643</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>יַ֫עַר</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>honeycomb</highlightword>, — absolute <bdbheb>יַעַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,25)\">1Sam 14:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:26\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,26)\">1Sam 14:26</ref> suffix <bdbheb>יַעְרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:1\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,1)\">Song 5:1</ref> — <highlight>honeycomb</highlight>, containing honey <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,25)\">1Sam 14:25</ref> (where read <bdbheb>וְיַעַר הָיָה עַלפְּֿנֵּי הַשָּׂדֶה</bdbheb> with <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau<sup>AT, instead of</sup></lookup> see as in M